          "start": 481
        },
        "quote": "(b) If the premises sought to be licensed under this chapter conform to the laws and regulations referred to in subsection (a) of this section, the inspectors shall so certify on the application of the applicant, and such inspectors shall thereafter make inspections at any time deemed necessary for the enforcement of the provisions of this chapter, as provided elsewhere. If the premises do not conform to such laws and regulations, the appropriate inspector shall deliver written notification specifying the reasons for such nonconformity to the applicant or an agent at the premises. (Ord. 20175 § 11, 3-12-19.)",
